    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Man in the Park 2: The Second Man in the Park is a short, multiple ending horror game where you try to make it out of your neighborhood park . . . alive . . . again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six possible endings (double the amount from the first game!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic big-screen jump scares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be completed in a single sitting (average playtime ~20 minutes)</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Man in the Park 2: The Second Man in the Park is a short, multiple ending horror game where you try to make it out of your neighborhood park . . . alive . . . again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six possible endings (double the amount from the first game!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic big-screen jump scares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be completed in a single sitting (average playtime ~20 minutes)</p></li></ul>",
